# Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com) — delivers contact-form submissions to
# info@nomadagro.uz. The form submits directly from the browser (Web3Forms'
# free plan rejects server-proxied requests), so this key must be
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ to be included in the client bundle. That's intentional: the
# key is meant to be public, protected by the "Allowed Domains" setting in
# the Web3Forms dashboard rather than secrecy.
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com, enter info@nomadagro.uz, and confirm the
#    verification email to get an Access Key.
# 2. Paste it below, then (recommended) restrict it to nomadagro.uz and
#    nomad-agro.vercel.app under the key's "Allowed Domains" setting.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# Copy this file to .env.local (already git-ignored) — never commit real keys.
